  "designNotes": "A calm, product-led SaaS look: a pale blue-white hero (#f1f4f9) with soft blue gradient light, a large Geist headline and two rows of animated activity chips (confirmed, urgent, booked) that read like a live operations feed. Below, the page drops into a deep-navy canvas (#0b1221) where product UI mockups float in glowing dark frames: a front-desk dashboard, a risk-and-quality table, a pharmacy inventory, an AI call transcript in Spanish and a patient app. Everything is set in Geist, with Geist Mono for small labels, in a restrained palette of slate greys and two brand blues (#57aee9, #277ab4). A tabbed \"complete suite\" section and a scroll-lit mission statement tie the modules together before the \"Give your team the day back.\" close.",
  "businessSummary": "Newbula is a healthcare operations platform for medical centers, health plans, pharmacies and adult day cares, built around one shared patient record. It covers front-desk and scheduling tools, an ambient scribe, fax and email intake, risk and quality analytics, pharmacy inventory, transportation, a patient app and AI voice agents that call patients in English and Spanish.",
  "keyCopy": [
    "Healthcare operations, handled.",
    "Newbula runs the calls, faxes, notes, rides and reports behind patient care, so your team can spend the day with patients.",
    "Every tool shares one patient record, so nothing gets typed twice and every call, fax and visit lands where it belongs.",
    "Calls every patient, in their language",
    "The visit note writes itself",
    "Give your team the day back."
  ],
